  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Let,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>c</mi></math>&nbsp;be the DRs.</p><p>The equation of a plane passing through <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced></math> is<br /><br /><math><mi>a</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi>c</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math> .... (i)<br /><br />Since, it passes through <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mi>&#160;</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> and is parallel to the given line<br /><br /><math><mo>&#8756;</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>a</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi>c</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br /><br />Also,&nbsp;<math><mn>2</mn><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>b</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>c</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br /><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>&#160;</mi><mfrac><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>28</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>b</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>c</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>14</mn></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>&#160;</mi><mfrac><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>b</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>c</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><br />Hence, <math><mi>a</mi><mi>&#160;</mi><mo>:</mo><mi>b</mi><mi>&#160;</mi><mo>:</mo><mi>c</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>&#160;</mi><mo>:</mo><mn>0</mn><mi>&#160;</mi><mo>:</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p>"
